皓話玄名聲，復徙玄及子據，付交阯將張奕，使以戰自效，陰別敕奕令殺之。據到交阯，病死。玄一身隨亦討賊，持刀步涉，見亦輒拜，亦未忍殺。會亦暴卒，玄殯斂亦，於器中見敕書，還便自殺。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-065-louxuan-complete:p004:m0019"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-065-louxuan-complete:p004","text":"　　皓話玄名聲，復徙玄及子據，付交阯將張奕，使以戰自效，陰別敕奕令殺之。據到交阯，病死。玄一身隨亦討賊，持刀步涉，見亦輒拜，亦未忍殺。會亦暴卒，玄殯斂亦，於器中見敕書，還便自殺。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":24,"last_line":24,"raw_start":1418,"raw_end":1620,"raw_character_offsets":[1418,1419,1420,1421,1422,1423,1424,1425,1426,1427,1428,1429,1430,1431,1432,1433,1434,1435,1436,1437,1438,1439,1440,1441,1442,1443,1444,1445,1446,1447,1448,1449,1450,1451,1452,1453,1454,1455,1456,1457,1458,1459,1460,1461,1462,1463,1464,1465,1466,1467,1468,1469,1470,1471,1472,1473,1474,1475,1476,1477,1478,1479,1480,1481,1482,1483,1484,1485,1486,1487,1488,1489,1490,1491,1492,1493,1494,1495,1496,1497,1498,1499,1500,1501,1502,1503,1504,1505,1506],"revision_id":2589669},"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-065-louxuan-complete:p004:m0002","surface":"皓","start":2,"end":3,"kind":"person","person_id":"05e_9bb_55a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-065-louxuan-complete:p004:m0004","surface":"玄","start":4,"end":5,"kind":"person","person_id":"30b_08l_rxm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-065-louxuan-complete:p004:m0010","surface":"玄","start":10,"end":11,"kind":"person","person_id":"30b_08l_rxm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-065-louxuan-complete:p004:m0013","surface":"據","start":13,"end":14,"kind":"person","person_id":"30b_08l_rxm_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-065-louxuan-complete:p004:m0019","surface":"張奕",